A collection of automation workflows built with n8n as part of my DevOps and automation learning journey. 
These workflows demonstrate real-world use cases using Google Sheets, Gmail, conditional logic, and form handling.

Workflows Built:
1- Form Submission Handler
Captures form submissions, checks if the applicant owns a laptop using an IF node, sends a tailored email response, appends their data to a Google Sheet, and updates their status automatically.
2-Experience Level Email Router
Reads applicant data from Google Sheet, uses a Switch node to route by experience level (Beginner, Intermediate, Advanced), sends a
customised email to each group, then updates their row in the sheet to reflect email was sent.

Tools and Nodes Used:
n8n, Google Sheets, Gmail, IF node, Switch node, Form trigger, Schedule trigger, Update row, Append row

Skills Demonstrated:
Workflow automation, conditional logic, data routing, Google Sheets integration, email automation, Git version control

